{
 "_comment": "Chat-free PRODUCTION-skill item\u2192counter rules. Per skill, ORDERED, first match wins. Resolved from the gained itemId (name via item_mapping). NO generic floor \u2014 the produced item IS the identity. match types: endswith|contains (compared LOWERCASE) | regex|in_set (compared ORIGINAL case) | default. qty:true multiplies by the gained quantity (arrows/bolts/darts made in batches). No itemId / no match \u2192 skill_unmapped (uncounted, surfaces for a later rule). Hot-reloaded by mtime. Verified vs OSRS Wiki 2026-07-19. Residual gaps (\u2192 unmapped): fired pottery, amulet stringing, non-metal-set arrows, snakeskin, farming harvest, hunter byproducts (feathers/bones \u2014 deliberately excluded so catches count once). SMITHING is NOT here \u2014 it is derived per-metal in code (_skill_smithing): <metal>BarsSmelted / <metal>ItemsSmithed, aligned to the ore tokens; non-metal products \u2192 itemsSmithed catch-all.",
